      "content": "SP 81 SE             BUCKLAND                 BUCKLAND VILLAGE                                               east side 5/56                                          Barn north of Lower Farm                                               north side of yard. 10.7.74 GV                                            II Small barn. C18 timber framed, weather boarded, tiled roof. Interior has some older re-used tie beams and braces to wall posts. Queen post trusses, mostly renewed C19. Lower open fronted cartshed at right- angles attached to west end. Brick rear wall, tiled roof. Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP8872312828"
    }
